{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y把部分心理动因和情绪转折从大字移到了小字，且有些细腻的心理过程被概括掉了，若观众只看大字，会损失一部分理解深度。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的大字更像一组清晰的叙事路标，每段的情绪变化和核心意思更容易被迅速抓住，连续看下来也更容易拼出完整的心理历程。X则把动机、矛盾和情绪变化放在同一层文字里，尤其在S01、S05、S06、S11和S13，对人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做交代得更充分，心理质感也更细腻。总体我选Y，但它的优势主要是信息组织和观看效率，并不意味着它在人物理解深度上全面胜过X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec926ce8-be92-47f2-882e-e9c27db8b86b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T191048039381Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:11:58.878314+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c53f7b8e2ce01572a0e9f39929efa59b22f8ed4e00deaef9c4020b22f4e3e4fc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we